# Keep superpowers plans and specs local

Planning and design-spec files under `docs/superpowers/plans/` and `docs/superpowers/specs/` are local working artifacts by default.

- Do not stage or include them in implementation pull requests unless the user explicitly asks to ship that documentation.
- Prefer leaving them untracked, or committing them only on a local/notes branch that is never opened as a PR.
- When opening a PR, run `git diff --name-only <base>...HEAD` and remove any `docs/superpowers/plans/**` or `docs/superpowers/specs/**` artifacts from the branch before pushing.
- Implementation code and tests still belong in the PR; only the plan/spec markdown is excluded.
